<title>UK: Carlton buys Spanish video producer.</title>
<headline>Carlton buys Spanish video producer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British media company Carlton Communications Plc said on Wednesday it was expanding its European video production capacity through the 1.7 million stg purchase of Spain's Televicine.</p>
<p>Carlton said the facility would combine with the existing operations of its Technicolor business in Britain, Italy and the Netherlands to service the expanding video sell-through market in Europe.</p>
<p>Carlton noted that the Spanish market has more than doubled since 1992 and said it planned to increase volumes and efficiency at the Televicine facility in Madrid.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
